      "deliveryComponents": [
        "Gurugram, Aug 10: Cars24 announced the launch of Deployment Inc, an independent enterprise AI company that will help organisations design, implement and operate AI systems across critical business workflows.",
        "Deployment Inc will give customers one accountable team. Its forward-deployed engineers, or FDEs, will work from inside the customer&rsquo;s organisation. They will begin with a specific workflow and an agreed business metric, connect the necessary models to the company&rsquo;s data and systems, deploy the new workflow against real traffic and remain involved until it operates reliably at scale.",
        "Deployment Inc plans to hire 50 engineers this month, primarily forward-deployed engineers, alongside AI strategy and go-to-market professionals. The company is also opening its first set of engagements to enterprises seeking to redesign critical operations around AI.",
        "Cars24 is investing an initial $5 million in Deployment Inc and will become its first customer. Deployment Inc will operate as an independent company serving enterprises across industries, including financial services, consumer businesses, healthcare, manufacturing, logistics and technology."
